cd /home/mike/nexus-code && gh pr comment 211 --body "**Owner decision (relayed by claude-code; the owner chose directly in-session):** for v1.0.0, provenance verification is **auto**, meaning verify when possible. The installer and \`nexus upgrade\` should both:
- verify when a trusted \`gh\` (\`/usr/bin/gh\` or \`/usr/local/bin/gh\`) is present;
- **print a notice when verification is skipped**, both when no trusted \`gh\` exists and when verification couldn't run;
- fail closed only with \`NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1\`;
- skip entirely with \`=0\`.

